<!doctype html><html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><title>Dark Studio · Biblioteca</title></head><body>
<aside><a class="brand" href="/">◧ <span>DARK<span class="light">STUDIO</span></span></a><div class="navlabel">SEU WORKSPACE</div><a class="nav active" href="/">▦ &nbsp; Biblioteca de referência</a><div class="aside-footer"><span class="dot"></span> Armazenamento local<br/><small>Seus arquivos, no seu computador.</small></div></aside>
<main><header><div class="breadcrumb">Workspace <span>/</span> Instagram</div><span class="pill">MÓDULO 01</span></header><section class="title"><div><p class="eyebrow">COLETE. ORGANIZE. CRIE.</p><h1>Biblioteca de referência<span>.</span></h1><p>Reúna os vídeos que vão dar origem às suas próximas ideias.</p></div><div class="local">↙<span>Do Instagram<br/><strong>para seu acervo</strong></span></div></section>
<section class="capture"><div class="number">01</div><div class="capture-body"><h2>Qual perfil vamos explorar?</h2><p>Cole o link ou informe o @ do perfil de referência.</p><form id="scan"><label class="sr" for="profile">Perfil do Instagram</label><div class="input-wrap"><span>@</span><input id="profile" name="profile" placeholder="nome.do.perfil" required autocomplete="off" maxlength="200"/></div><label class="limit-label">Vídeos<select id="limit"><option value="5" selected>5 vídeos</option><option value="10">10 vídeos</option><option value="25">25 vídeos</option><option value="50">50 vídeos</option><option value="0">Todos</option></select></label><button id="submit" type="submit">Buscar e baixar <span>↗</span></button></form><p class="hint">A coleta percorre os vídeos acessíveis e preserva os downloads já concluídos.</p><details class="session-help"><summary>Como funciona a coleta?</summary><p>O coletor navega pelos Reels públicos, fecha convites de cadastro e salva a mídia acessível no player. Se o Instagram exigir autenticação, a coleta fica incompleta. O limite controla quantos vídeos serão selecionados nesta rodada.</p></details><p id="feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div></section>
<section class="stats" aria-label="Resumo"><div><span>VÍDEOS ENCONTRADOS</span><strong id="total">0</strong></div><div><span>NO SEU ACERVO</span><strong id="downloaded">0</strong></div><div><span>PENDENTES</span><strong id="pending">0</strong></div></section>
<section class="collection"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Seu acervo <span id="count">0</span></h2><div class="collection-tools"><a id="download-all" class="download-all" href="/api/export" download="dark-studio-videos.zip" hidden>↓ Baixar todos (.zip)</a><label>Exibir <select id="filter"><option value="all">Todos os vídeos</option><option value="downloaded">No acervo</option><option value="failed">Com falha</option></select></label></div></div><div id="profile-tabs" class="profile-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Filtrar por perfil"></div><div id="job" class="job" hidden></div><div id="empty" class="empty"><div class="empty-icon">▤</div><h3>Seu próximo vídeo começa com uma referência.</h3><p>Adicione um perfil acima para montar sua biblioteca.<br/>Os vídeos baixados vão aparecer aqui.</p><span>Instagram → Biblioteca → Suas ideias</span></div><div id="videos" class="grid"></div></section>
<footer>Dark Studio <span>Biblioteca local · Instagram</span></footer></main>
<script>
const $ = (s:string)=>document.querySelector(s) as HTMLElement;
const form=$('#scan') as HTMLFormElement, submit=$('#submit') as HTMLButtonElement, filter=$('#filter') as HTMLSelectElement;
let library:any={videos:[],jobs:[]}, signature='', selectedProfile='';
const labels:any={scanning:'Buscando vídeos',downloading:'Baixando',completed:'Concluído',partial:'Concluído com pendências',failed:'Falha na coleta',interrupted:'Interrompido',pending:'Pendente',downloaded:'No acervo'};
function element(tag:string,text:string,className=''){const el=document.createElement(tag);el.textContent=text;el.className=className;return el;}
function render(){
 const profiles=[...new Set(library.videos.map(v=>v.profile))].sort() as string[];
 const tabs=$('#profile-tabs');
 const tabSignature=JSON.stringify([profiles,selectedProfile]);
 if(tabs.dataset.signature!==tabSignature){
 tabs.dataset.signature=tabSignature;tabs.replaceChildren();
 for(const profile of ['',...profiles]){const tab=element('button',profile?'@'+profile:'Todos','profile-tab');tab.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(profile===selectedProfile));tab.addEventListener('click',()=>{selectedProfile=profile;render();});tabs.append(tab);}
 }
 const all=library.videos.filter(v=>!selectedProfile||v.profile===selectedProfile);
 const download=$('#download-all') as HTMLAnchorElement;
 download.hidden=!all.some(v=>v.status==='downloaded');
 download.href='/api/export'+(selectedProfile?'?profile='+encodeURIComponent(selectedProfile):'');
 download.textContent=selectedProfile?'↓ Baixar perfil (.zip)':'↓ Baixar todos (.zip)';
 download.download=selectedProfile?`dark-studio-${selectedProfile}.zip`:'dark-studio-videos.zip';
 const videos=all.filter(v=>filter.value==='all'||v.status===filter.value);
 $('#total').textContent=String(all.length);$('#count').textContent=String(all.length);$('#downloaded').textContent=String(all.filter(v=>v.status==='downloaded').length);$('#pending').textContent=String(all.filter(v=>v.status!=='downloaded').length);
 const job=library.jobs.find(j=>!selectedProfile||j.profile===selectedProfile), active=library.jobs.some(j=>['scanning','downloading'].includes(j.status));
 submit.disabled=!!active;
 const jobEl=$('#job');jobEl.hidden=!job;jobEl.replaceChildren();
 if(job){jobEl.append(element('strong',`@${job.profile} · ${labels[job.status]}`),element('span',job.message));if(!['scanning','downloading'].includes(job.status)){const retry=element('button','Atualizar / retomar');retry.addEventListener('click',()=>{($('#profile') as HTMLInputElement).value=job.profile;form.requestSubmit();});jobEl.append(retry);}}
 const empty=$('#empty');empty.hidden=videos.length>0;
 if(all.length&&!videos.length){empty.querySelector('h3')!.textContent='Nenhum vídeo neste filtro.';empty.querySelector('p')!.textContent='Selecione outra opção para ver seu acervo.';}
 const next=JSON.stringify(videos);
 if(next===signature)return;signature=next;
 const grid=$('#videos');grid.replaceChildren();
 for(const v of videos){
  const card=element('article','','card');
  if(v.status==='downloaded'){const media=document.createElement('video');media.controls=true;media.preload='metadata';media.src=`/api/media?id=${encodeURIComponent(v.id)}`;media.setAttribute('playsinline','');card.append(media);}
  else card.append(element('div',v.status==='failed'?'Não foi possível baixar':'Aguardando download','placeholder'));
  const content=element('div','','card-content');content.append(element('span',labels[v.status],`status ${v.status}`),element('h3',`@${v.profile}`),element('p',v.caption||'Publicação sem legenda.','caption'),element('small',new Date(/Z$|[+-]\d{2}:\d{2}$/.test(v.published)?v.published:v.published+'Z').toLocaleDateString('pt-BR')));
  if(v.error)content.append(element('p',v.error,'error'));
  const actions=element('div','','actions'), source=document.createElement('a');source.textContent='Ver original ↗';source.href=v.source;source.target='_blank';source.rel='noopener noreferrer';actions.append(source);
  if(v.status==='downloaded'){const download=document.createElement('a');download.textContent='↓ Baixar vídeo';download.href=`/api/media?id=${encodeURIComponent(v.id)}&download=1`;actions.append(download);}content.append(actions);card.append(content);grid.append(card);
 }
}
async function refresh(){try{const response=await fetch('/api/library');if(!response.ok)throw Error('Não foi possível atualizar a biblioteca.');library=await response.json();render();}catch(e){$('#feedback').textContent=e.message;}}
form.addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();submit.disabled=true;$('#feedback').textContent='Iniciando coleta…';try{const r=await fetch('/api/library',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({profile:($('#profile') as HTMLInputElement).value,limit:Number(($('#limit') as HTMLSelectElement).value)})});const data=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw Error(data.error);selectedProfile=data.profile;$('#feedback').textContent=`Coleta de @${data.profile} iniciada.`;setTimeout(refresh,600);}catch(e){$('#feedback').textContent=e.message;submit.disabled=false;}});
filter.addEventListener('change',render);refresh();setInterval(refresh,2500);
</script>
<style is:global>
.profile-tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;overflow-x:auto;padding:4px 0 16px;margin-bottom:10px}.profile-tab{background:#1b2027;color:#aeb8c5;border:1px solid #343d49;padding:10px 16px;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0}.profile-tab[aria-pressed="true"]{background:#29351e;border-color:#789650;color:#c0ef6c}

.collection-tools{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:flex-end}.download-all{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;background:#c0ef6c;color:#1c2511;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;padding:10px 15px;border-radius:7px}.limit-label{font-size:12px;color:#aab2bd;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}.limit-label select{margin:0;padding:6px}.session-help{margin-top:18px;font-size:14px;color:#b6c3a8}.session-help summary{cursor:pointer}.session-help p{line-height:1.7}code{color:#c0ef6c}:root{font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#ebedf0;background:#0d0f12;font-synthesis:none;color-scheme:dark}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}button,input,select{font:inherit}button,a,input,select{-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}button{cursor:pointer}button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:wait}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #c0ef6c;outline-offset:4px}[hidden]{display:none!important}aside{width:248px;position:fixed;inset:0 auto 0 0;border-right:1px solid #25282d;padding:35px 20px;background:#111317}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:23px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-1px}.brand>span{font-size:17px;letter-spacing:.5px}.light{font-weight:400;color:#9b9fa8}.navlabel{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#7f8590;margin:60px 10px 18px}.nav{display:block;font-size:14px;padding:15px 12px;border-radius:7px}.active{background:#22291c;color:#c0ef6c}.aside-footer{position:absolute;bottom:30px;font-size:14px;color:#b8bdc6}.aside-footer small{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#787f89;margin-top:10px}.dot{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#c0ef6c;margin-right:7px}main{margin-left:248px;padding:0 48px;max-width:1550px}header{height:90px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #24272d;font-size:14px;color:#a7abb3}.breadcrumb span{margin:0 15px;color:#515761}.pill{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;border:1px solid #363b43;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:5px}.title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin:44px 0 32px}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#c0ef6c}h1{font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,42px);letter-spacing:-1.5px;margin:13px 0}h1 span{color:#c0ef6c}.title p:not(.eyebrow){color:#9bA1ab;font-size:16px}.local{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;font-size:42px;color:#c0ef6c}.local span{font-size:13px;color:#949ca5;line-height:1.7}.local strong{color:#d6dbe2;font-weight:500}.capture{display:flex;gap:25px;padding:30px;background:#171a1f;border:1px solid #30353b;border-radius:12px}.number{color:#c0ef6c;font-size:14px;padding-top:4px}.capture-body{flex:1}h2{font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.3px;margin:0}.capture p{color:#969da7;font-size:14px;margin:10px 0 22px}form{display:flex;gap:12px}.input-wrap{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:#0f1115;border:1px solid #3b414a;border-radius:7px;padding:0 16px}.input-wrap span{color:#7c858f}input{width:100%;border:0;background:transparent;padding:16px 0;outline:0;color:#fff}.input-wrap:focus-within{border-color:#c0ef6c}button{background:#c0ef6c;color:#1c2511;border:0;border-radius:7px;padding:14px 22px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px}button span{margin-left:22px}.capture .hint{font-size:12px;margin:13px 0 0;color:#858c97}#feedback{margin-bottom:0;color:#c8dcac}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);margin:26px 0 38px;border-bottom:1px solid #292d33;padding-bottom:25px}.stats>div{padding:0 26px;border-right:1px solid #292d33}.stats>div:first-child{padding-left:0}.stats>div:last-child{border:0}.stats span{display:block;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#8f97a2}.stats strong{display:block;font-size:32px;font-weight:500;margin-top:12px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.section-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:22px}.section-heading h2 span{background:#272c33;color:#aeb6c0;font-size:12px;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:5px;margin-left:10px}.section-heading label{font-size:13px;color:#858e99}select{margin-left:8px;border:1px solid #333944;background:#16191e;padding:9px;border-radius:6px;color:#d5dae1;font-size:14px}.empty{border:1px dashed #343b45;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;padding:42px 20px}.empty-icon{font-size:30px;color:#c0ef6c;background:#20261b;border:1px solid #39432d;width:60px;height:60px;margin:auto;border-radius:12px;padding:10px}.empty h3{font-size:17px;font-weight:500;margin-top:22px}.empty p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#8f97a2}.empty>span{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#707986;margin-top:25px}.job{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:#1c2319;border:1px solid #3a4632;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:14px}.job span{flex:1;color:#b9c6ae}.job button{padding:9px 12px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px}.card{border:1px solid #303640;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#16191f}.card video,.placeholder{width:100%;height:280px;background:#080a0d;object-fit:contain}.placeholder{display:grid;place-items:center;color:#8e98a5;font-size:14px}.card-content{padding:18px}.status{font-size:12px;color:#c3c8cf}.status.downloaded{color:#c0ef6c}.status.failed,.error{color:#ffaaaa}.card h3{font-size:16px}.caption{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#aab2bd;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:3;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}.card small{font-size:12px;color:#929caa}.actions{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;border-top:1px solid #303640;margin-top:16px;padding-top:14px;font-size:13px}.actions a:last-child{color:#c0ef6c}footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#6d7682;font-size:12px;margin:35px 0 25px}.sr{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0)}@media(max-width:1100px){aside{width:205px;padding:30px 12px}main{margin-left:205px;padding:0 25px}.local{display:none}.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:720px){aside{position:static;width:auto;padding:18px;border-bottom:1px solid #292d33}.navlabel,.nav,.aside-footer{display:none}main{margin:0;padding:0 20px}header{height:65px}.title{margin-top:28px}.capture{padding:22px 18px}.number{display:none}form{flex-direction:column}button{min-height:46px}.stats>div{padding:0 12px}.stats span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.5px}.stats strong{font-size:28px}.section-heading{align-items:flex-start;gap:10px}.section-heading label{font-size:0}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.empty{padding:32px 15px}.title p:not(.eyebrow){line-height:1.6}footer span{font-size:11px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){button{transition:background .15s ease,transform .15s ease}button:active{transform:scale(.98)}}
</style></body></html>
